  "question": {
    "text": "The standard e.m.f of a cell, involving one electron change is found to be $0.591 \\mathrm{~V}$ at $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$. The equilibrium constant of the reaction is $\\left(\\mathrm{F}=96,500 \\mathrm{C} \\mathrm{mol}^{-1}: \\mathrm{R}=8.314 \\mathrm{JK}^{-1} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}\\right)$",
    "image": null
  },
